    "body": "Try running `starship explain`. This is likely the `battery` module, which will use nerd font icons for its symbols by default. It should display correctly if you change to a nerd font or change the symbols to something else.\r\nIn the future, the module will likely switch to emoji by default (#3544).\r\n\r\nDoes this solve your issue?",
